From 30426bf8a3e1b57596ee741086e2c491617c58d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shandongtlb <40312509+shandongtlb@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 17:36:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wlan: restore monitor context and RX across global SSR

Keep saved monitor channels outside the STA session union. Rebuild DP
monitor and power policy before TX restore, preserve WEXT handlers and
paused interfaces, and skip impossible monitor response waits when
firmware is down.

Add production-code host regressions with a failing old-layout control.
Unified build and device validation remain pending.
